{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108099","id":2626652863,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6cj4q_","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108099","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108099.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108099.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108099","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108099/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108099/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108099/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0df59567dd81da01083a80114e95b6d48fec77c9","number":108099,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"`GraphEdit`/`GraphNode` Overhaul","user":{"login":"dawdle-deer","id":29020074,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MDIwMDc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29020074?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer","html_url":"https://github.com/dawdle-deer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dawdle-deer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR restructures the graph system for friendlier usage and greater flexibility.\r\n- Introduce `GraphPort`, a generic `GraphElement` to which connections can be made.\r\n- Split `GraphNode` into two nodes: `GraphNodeIndexed`, which inherits the current `GraphNode` behaviour of associating children with slots and generating+placing `GraphPort`s automatically, and `GraphNode`, a base class designed for the flexible creation of nodes that contain ports.\r\n- Introduce `GraphConnection`, a resource representing connections between `GraphPort`s in a `GraphEdit`.\r\n\r\nResolves https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/12207 - read the description there for more details.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e5105b7c-5745-4c90-81f0-74f33d58678f\r\n\r\n\r\nNotably, this implementation does not overhaul `VisualShader` or `VisualShaderNode`. I believe a future PR that overhauls the visual shader system in parallel would be a good idea, but for this PR, changes will be relegated to `VisualShaderNodePlugin` and seek to maintain compatibility as much as possible.\r\n\r\nTODO:\r\n- [x] Fix ~~so many~~ regressions and bugs\r\n- [x] Ensure back-compatibility with visual shaders\r\n- [x] Documentation\r\n- [x] Improve keyboard navigation and accessibility features\r\n- [ ] ~~Compatibility~~\r\n- [ ] ~~Associate slots with nested children of `GraphNodeIndexed`~~\r\n\r\nEdit 7/20/25: With GraphPort being an independent node, tracking nested children with `GraphNodeIndexed` slots has proven somewhat unnecessary. This could be reintroduced in a separate PR, if someone has need of it.\r\nEdit 8/5/25: Certain aspects of this PR break compatibility beyond what I can handle. I'm going forward with the assumption that this will fully break compat. GraphShaders will still work as expected.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":